# NOCAP: NLP for Opinion Classification and Aspect Processing

An AI-powered Employee Feedback Analysis System that combines Natural Language Processing (NLP), sentiment analysis, topic modeling, aspect extraction, and a modern web dashboard to help organizations analyze employee reviews and generate actionable insights.

---

## Features

### Backend (FastAPI)

- RESTful API built with FastAPI
- JWT Authentication
- Company & Admin accounts
- CSV review import
- Automatic NLP pipeline
- Sentiment Analysis (RoBERTa)
- Aspect Extraction
- Aspect-Based Sentiment Analysis
- Topic Modeling (BERTopic)
- Keyword Extraction
- AI-generated Recommendations
- Dashboard Analytics
- PostgreSQL integration
- Repository + Unit of Work architecture

---

### Frontend (Next.js)

- Next.js + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Responsive Dashboard
- Company Portal
- Admin Portal
- AI Processing Dashboard
- Review History
- Company Management
- Authentication

---

