## Architecture

The backend follows a layered architecture.

```
FastAPI
     │
     ▼
Application Services
     │
     ▼
Unit of Work
     │
     ▼
Repositories
     │
     ▼
SQLAlchemy Models
     │
     ▼
PostgreSQL
```

The NLP pipeline is organized separately:

```
CSV
    │
    ▼
Validation
    │
    ▼
Mapping
    │
    ▼
Review Analyzer
    │
    ├── Sentiment Analysis
    ├── Topic Modeling
    ├── Aspect Extraction
    ├── Keyword Extraction
    └── Recommendation
    │
    ▼
Database
```

